setup_notes.content:
pip install ovos-skill-autovolume

This also installs the plugin, but OVOS only runs it once it is named in the
`audio_transformers` section of `mycroft.conf`:

{
  "audio_transformers": {
    "ovos-audio-transformer-plugin-autovolume": {}
  }
}

Without it the skill says that auto volume isn't set up on this device.

In Emkay the listener doesn't feed audio transformers yet; that is
[emkay#105](https://github.com/emkay-voice/emkay/issues/105).
